@startuml
title 문서 요청 런타임 · arc42 Runtime View

actor 방문자 as user
participant 브라우저 as browser
participant "proxy.ts" as proxy
participant "App Router page" as route
participant "Content repository" as repository
participant "Fumadocs MDX loader" as mdx
participant Kroki as kroki

user -> browser: tech.jamie.kr/docs 요청
browser -> proxy: GET /ko/docs/fe/nextjs-16\nHost: tech.jamie.kr
proxy -> proxy: Host=tech, locale=ko 해석
proxy -> route: /tech/ko/docs/fe/nextjs-16로 rewrite
route -> repository: 공개 문서 metadata 조회
repository -> repository: production snapshot 재사용\ndevelopment에서는 매번 재검증
route -> mdx: locale·slug 본문 load()
mdx --> route: React MDX component, TOC, frontmatter
route --> browser: HTML, RSC payload, 필요한 client bundle
browser --> user: 문서와 탐색 UI 표시
opt 본문에 PlantUML 다이어그램이 있음
  browser -> kroki: 인코딩된 SVG URL 요청
  kroki --> browser: SVG
end
@enduml
